sequenceDiagram
    participant Writer
    participant Primary@{ "type": "database" }
    participant Wal@{ "type": "queue" } as Write-ahead log
    participant Replica@{ "type": "collections" } as Read replicas

    Writer->>+Primary: BEGIN#59; UPDATE accounts SET balance = balance - 25
    Primary->>Wal: append(lsn=4821)
    Primary-->>-Writer: COMMIT
    par stream to replicas
        Wal-)Replica: lsn=4821
    and acknowledge the writer
        Wal--)Primary: flushed(lsn=4821)
    end
    Note right of Replica: Replicas serve reads at lsn 4821 once applied
    Replica-->>Wal: applied(lsn=4821)
